- Meet at an art museum
	Finn and Kelp meet at MOMA, Museum of Manatee Art
	Kelp: Yo! I’m Kelp from Reel Love. Love the suit, dawg. What is that? Polyester blend?
	Finn: Dawg?? Polyester blend?? It’s Finn and my suit’s pigment is made from crushed gooseneck barnacles and very expensive.
	Kelp: My bad bro, guess I’m bad with fabrics. Sick place you chose, lovin’ the art here. They speak to me. Like this one here, it’s saying, “Finn, your blue barnacle suit and my graphic tee complement each other well.”
	Finn: That’s not what that phrase is meant to convey…I don’t think this is going to work out. I’m taking my leave, my bet is fulfilled.
	Kelp: Whatever floats your boat, I’ma chill with these paintings. 
	After date
	Finn: Was this date a prank?
	+0 satisfaction. Neither heartbroken, neither fulfilled 
	Kelp: I don’t think he appreciated my jokes. But check out what I got at the gift shop, it’s a magnet of a manatee riding a whale shark, HAHA!
	+0 satisfaction. Neither heartbroken, neither fulfilled
